{"title": "Mindsteal Link (Target) (Condition)", "pageid": 30212, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mindsteal_Link_(Target)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Psychic Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Generic_Psychic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Mindsteal Link</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Being drained by <a href=\"/wiki/Ch%27r%27ai_W%27wargaz\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ch'r'ai W'wargaz\">Ch'r'ai W'wargaz</a>.</li>\n<li>Received a -2 penalty on its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and is <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to Psychic damage.</li>\n<li>Condition ends when the affected entity damages Ch'r'ai W'wargaz. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CRE_MINDSTEAL_LINK_TARGET</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCRE_MINDSTEAL_LINK_TARGET%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCRE_MINDSTEAL_LINK_TARGET%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thum